{"id":"43b99c61f80582d8","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-divergences.md","title":"Statistical Divergences","display":"df-divergences — Statistical Divergences","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-divergences","aliases":["58-df-divergences","Divergence (Statistics)"],"display":"df-divergences — Statistical Divergences","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-df-probability.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-kullback-leibler.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-density-function.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-divergences"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-divergences</span><span>Divergence (Statistics)</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-divergences — Statistical Divergences"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5e0db065132180df\" href=\"?note=5e0db065132180df\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-probability.md\">../batch08/58-df-probability.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5164bda26b0e7924\" href=\"?note=5164bda26b0e7924\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-kullback-leibler.md\">../batch11/58-df-kullback-leibler.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d4fc4686aaece886\" href=\"?note=d4fc4686aaece886\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-density-function.md\">../batch11/58-df-density-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" href=\"?note=76a1ed4ae7e8b05d\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md\">../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal F,P,Q,f,h,d_{\\mathrm{KL}},d_f,d_{\\chi^2}\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal F,P,Q,f,h,d_{\\mathrm{KL}},d_f,d_{\\chi^2}\\in V\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5e0db065132180df\" href=\"?note=5e0db065132180df\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-probability.md\">../batch08/58-df-probability.md</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> 使用内部集合函数谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DensityFunction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{DensityFunction}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KLDivergence}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{KLDivergence}_S\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S\\)</span> 使用所列依赖中的定义。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RNDerivative}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{RNDerivative}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DivergenceTriple}_S\\subseteq V^8\">\\(\\mathrm{DivergenceTriple}_S\\subseteq V^8\\)</span> 由下式定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}divergences\\text{-}rn}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RNDerivative}_S(h,P,Q,X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{DensityFunction}_S(h,P,Q,X,\\mathcal F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}divergences\\text{-}rn}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RNDerivative}_S(h,P,Q,X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{DensityFunction}_S(h,P,Q,X,\\mathcal F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}divergences\\text{-}triple}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DivergenceTriple}_S(d_{\\mathrm{KL}},d_f,d_{\\chi^2},f,P,Q,X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(P,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(Q,X,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,[0,\\infty),\\mathbb R)\\land f(1)=0\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in[0,\\infty)\\;\\forall t\\in[0,1]\\;\nf(tx+(1-t)y)\\leq tf(x)+(1-t)f(y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land d_{\\mathrm{KL}},d_f,d_{\\chi^2}\\in[0,\\infty]\n\\land\\mathrm{KLDivergence}_S(d_{\\mathrm{KL}},P,Q,X,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Bigl(\\bigl[\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;(Q(A)=0\\to P(A)=0)\\bigr]\\to\n\\exists h\\in[0,\\infty)^X\\;\\exists a\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\mathrm{RNDerivative}_S(h,P,Q,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\forall t\\in[0,\\infty)\\;f(t)\\geq a(t-1)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S\n\\bigl(d_f,\\{\\langle x,f(h(x))-a(h(x)-1)\\rangle:x\\in X\\},X,\\mathcal F,Q\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S\n\\bigl(d_{\\chi^2},\\{\\langle x,(h(x)-1)^2\\rangle:x\\in X\\},X,\\mathcal F,Q\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Bigl(\\bigl[\\exists A\\in\\mathcal F\\;(Q(A)=0\\land P(A)&gt;0)\\bigr]\n\\to d_{\\mathrm{KL}}=d_f=d_{\\chi^2}=\\infty\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}divergences\\text{-}triple}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DivergenceTriple}_S(d_{\\mathrm{KL}},d_f,d_{\\chi^2},f,P,Q,X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(P,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(Q,X,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,[0,\\infty),\\mathbb R)\\land f(1)=0\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y\\in[0,\\infty)\\;\\forall t\\in[0,1]\\;\nf(tx+(1-t)y)\\leq tf(x)+(1-t)f(y)\\\\\n&amp;\\land d_{\\mathrm{KL}},d_f,d_{\\chi^2}\\in[0,\\infty]\n\\land\\mathrm{KLDivergence}_S(d_{\\mathrm{KL}},P,Q,X,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Bigl(\\bigl[\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;(Q(A)=0\\to P(A)=0)\\bigr]\\to\n\\exists h\\in[0,\\infty)^X\\;\\exists a\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\mathrm{RNDerivative}_S(h,P,Q,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\forall t\\in[0,\\infty)\\;f(t)\\geq a(t-1)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S\n\\bigl(d_f,\\{\\langle x,f(h(x))-a(h(x)-1)\\rangle:x\\in X\\},X,\\mathcal F,Q\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S\n\\bigl(d_{\\chi^2},\\{\\langle x,(h(x)-1)^2\\rangle:x\\in X\\},X,\\mathcal F,Q\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Bigl(\\bigl[\\exists A\\in\\mathcal F\\;(Q(A)=0\\land P(A)&gt;0)\\bigr]\n\\to d_{\\mathrm{KL}}=d_f=d_{\\chi^2}=\\infty\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>RNDerivative_S 现在显式要求测度、非负性及可测性，不把任意数值图称为密度。</li>\n<li>对有限凸函数，在 1 处减去一条支持直线使被积函数非负；概率归一化使被减去的线性项积分为零，因此保留原 f 散度的值。</li>\n<li>特意保留原文件在非绝对连续时令三个量同时为正无穷的约定，不替换成其他文献中的延拓约定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Csiszár, Information-Theoretic Concepts</li>\n<li>Cover and Thomas, Elements of Information Theory</li>\n<li>Amari, Information Geometry</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-probability.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e0db065132180df","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-probability.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-kullback-leibler.md","status":"resolved","id":"5164bda26b0e7924","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-kullback-leibler.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-density-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"d4fc4686aaece886","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-density-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"76a1ed4ae7e8b05d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-signed-integral-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-probability.md","status":"resolved","id":"5e0db065132180df","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}$ 使用 [[../batch08/58-df-probability.md]]；$\\mathrm{Function}$ 使用内部集合函数谓词。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal F,P,Q,f,h,d_{\\mathrm{KL}},d_f,d_{\\chi^2}\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DensityFunction}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{KLDivergence}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RNDerivative}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DivergenceTriple}_S\\subseteq V^8","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}divergences\\text{-}rn}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RNDerivative}_S(h,P,Q,X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{DensityFunction}_S(h,P,Q,X,\\mathcal F).","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}divergences\\text{-}triple}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{DivergenceTriple}_S(d_{\\mathrm{KL}},d_f,d_{\\chi^2},f,P,Q,X,\\mathcal F)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(P,X,\\mathcal F)\\land\\operatorname{ProbabilityMeasure}(Q,X,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,[0,\\infty),\\mathbb R)\\land f(1)=0\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y\\in[0,\\infty)\\;\\forall t\\in[0,1]\\;\nf(tx+(1-t)y)\\leq tf(x)+(1-t)f(y)\\\\\n&\\land d_{\\mathrm{KL}},d_f,d_{\\chi^2}\\in[0,\\infty]\n\\land\\mathrm{KLDivergence}_S(d_{\\mathrm{KL}},P,Q,X,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&\\land\\Bigl(\\bigl[\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;(Q(A)=0\\to P(A)=0)\\bigr]\\to\n\\exists h\\in[0,\\infty)^X\\;\\exists a\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl(\\\\\n&\\qquad\\mathrm{RNDerivative}_S(h,P,Q,X,\\mathcal F)\n\\land\\forall t\\in[0,\\infty)\\;f(t)\\geq a(t-1)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S\n\\bigl(d_f,\\{\\langle x,f(h(x))-a(h(x)-1)\\rangle:x\\in X\\},X,\\mathcal F,Q\\bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{NonnegativeIntegralValue}_S\n\\bigl(d_{\\chi^2},\\{\\langle x,(h(x)-1)^2\\rangle:x\\in X\\},X,\\mathcal F,Q\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\Bigl(\\bigl[\\exists A\\in\\mathcal F\\;(Q(A)=0\\land P(A)>0)\\bigr]\n\\to d_{\\mathrm{KL}}=d_f=d_{\\chi^2}=\\infty\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2847,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-446","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-divergences.md|58-df-divergences]]（batch04）"}],"outgoing":["5e0db065132180df","5164bda26b0e7924","36d7463d215be751","d4fc4686aaece886","76a1ed4ae7e8b05d"]}